{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tkwldvwjwmLGg5GWfSRHsQ","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:29.178937+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/tkwldvwjwmLGg5GWfSRHsQ","html":"<div><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/rEmuHaIQ7La16VGvIOCcVicfberTa3EZ4qbVicYa22CVLDVianI5Ix47EtdpvPrvH6ZdbzqOCwSp6YVhVc0lGwuyw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>福建中医药大学药学院</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>全国优秀大学生/硕士生</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏</span><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><p><span>令</span></p></section><section><section><p><span>营</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/VxGua2RwA4fialviaDEaSC98ZeeAwFPNavqvb7mfqLj3LnFxWZUuY0EyuymnHC6T9h5bxYXq5oCwSnnwhXh55dwA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>坐落于东南沿海的福建省，依山傍海、气候温润，既承载着“山海相拥”的自然格局，也孕育出开放包容、兼容并蓄的区域文化传统。这里自古为海上丝绸之路的重要起点，闽都文化、闽南文化与客家文化交融共生，形成独具特色的人文底蕴与学术土壤。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>近年来，福建经济持续稳步发展，产业结构不断优化升级，医药健康、生物医药与现代服务业发展势头强劲，为高层次医学与药学人才培养提供了坚实的现实基础与广阔的实践舞台。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>在此背景下，依托深厚的中医药文化积淀与现代药学教育体系，福建中医药大学药学院举办第二届全国优秀大学生夏令营，诚邀全国优秀学子走进福建、走进中医药的传承与创新前沿，在山海之间启航学术理想与科研之路。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qpicJQVTfQpRtYRUAj9yR6WrpbdIxVdxia5hAoicSE1D8OO2L2pBBicmJQYpXZXVsIezOVaxfbRpicfyef7LRMZyALz0Zem1GIMtXrolHD5Dsr54/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>福建中医药大学</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>⚘</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JJvb85tQl1XEsRUTDVyibu6wlxia2pjiaW3sTWVo0libPpibiajTtL2cCKjia3Utfibo1Q6vZ0d6PFibksPyIZxAT8tXB1T2Fd2fkdCteDMdibRwlDraw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/mfDGZ6IaiaO8KKVekUiaibDBqRuQQTFLvjgZeI27Aq0CiaRDY6xd8PMzjnYWqOccZwWAD67DJ8zgSLXRsGpg31BDVA/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>|</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>福建中医药大学创建于1958年，是我国创办较早的高等中医药院校之一，两次入选福建省重点建设高校，是福建省“双一流”建设高校，是福建省人民政府、国家中医药管理局共建高校。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>山海福建</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>活力福州</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>药学院</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>|</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>福建中医药大学药学院办学历史可追溯至1958年本草教研组，1985年成立中药系，2000年更名为药学系，2010年更名为药学院。经过六十余年建设，学院已形成以中药学为特色、药学多学科交叉融合发展的办学格局，下设4个系、1个研究所、1个实验技术中心、10个教研室。</span></p><p><span>近年来，药学院不断开拓、奋力而为，坚持“学科交叉融合、多元协同创新”，引进多名多学科高层次人才，取得了令人瞩目的跨越式发展。ESI药理学与毒理学学科进入全球排名前0.66%，获批福建省中药学拔尖学生培养基地班（本硕博一体化）建设项目；可进行博士博士后贯通培养。拥有全球前2%顶尖科学家、国家中组部特聘教授、教育部青年长江学者、省高层次人才、省百千万人才、省雏鹰计划人才、省高校杰出青年人才等一批专家学者。</span></p><p><span>当前，学院聚焦五大核心研究方向：一是建立基于结构药理学的多层次作用机制研究方法，推动“以靶寻药”与“以药找靶”双向融合；二是建立基于PROTAC的中药化学生物学新技术，破解中药成分弱亲和力靶点鉴定难题；三是开展闽台中药资源普查、选育、规范种植和推广示范；四是开展闽台特色炮制工艺及毒性药材炮制减毒研究；五是开展中药及天然药物活性成分新型递送系统研究。上述方向与人工智能辅助药物设计、多组学整合、蛋白质结构生物学和中药化学生物学深度交叉，已形成面向重大疾病和中药产业升级的研究生创新训练体系。</span></p><p><span>学院每年招收中药学学术型博士，及中药学、药理学、药剂学、药物分析、药物化学、生药学、微生物与生化药学、海洋药物学、医药大数据与人工智能等学术型硕士研究生，中药学专业学位硕士研究生，同时招收全国各专业推免硕士研究生若干名。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>厚德载物</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>传承创新</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JJvb85tQl1W8s4ibeDm8TaydS4zGOcb0WPPkpqRhkeB8rOy3hAhJT7p4MCy1Og7y04bkvxmQGWGHGImhxmdC770GzVdHZbuMBJDhMrKtTiahI/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qpicJQVTfQpRtYRUAj9yR6WrpbdIxVdxia5hAoicSE1D8OO2L2pBBicmJQYpXZXVsIezOVaxfbRpicfyef7LRMZyALz0Zem1GIMtXrolHD5Dsr54/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><b><span>2026年优秀大学生/硕士生夏令营</span></b></p><p><b><span>招生进行中</span></b></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>夏令营概况</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>以特色研究方向介绍、学术交流、校园参观等形式，为国内外优秀大学生/硕士生（包括本校）提供深入了解药学院的机会，并体验福建、福州、福建中医药大学学术与生活氛围。本次夏令营拟招收线下营员50名。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>a. 拥护中国共产党的领导，愿为社会主义现代化建设服务，品德良好，遵纪守法。</span></p><p><span>b. 全国高校2027届中药学、药学类专业</span><strong><span><span>本科、硕士应届毕业生</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>c. 本科生学习成绩和综合素质优异，英语通过四级；硕士生综合科研素质优异，已发表/即将发表第一作者论文，英语通过六级。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>申请方式</span></b></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>报名将相关证明材料原件按以下顺序扫描并整合成一个PDF文件发送邮箱（文件命名：夏令营-就读学校-姓名）：</span></p><p><span>a. 夏令营申请表1份（扫描下方二维码，下载并填写报名表，本人亲笔签字）</span></p><p><span>b.本科/硕士成绩单</span></p><p><span><span>以上a&amp;b须加盖院系或学校教务处公章</span></span></p><p><span>c.英语水平证明材料</span></p><p><span>d.其他材料：包括能体现自身学术水平的学术论文、出版物或原创性工作成果、获奖证书等材料。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>即日起至2026年</span><span><span>7月20日16:00</span></span><span>，逾期不再接收。未按规定扫描材料和发送邮件的，视为放弃报名资格。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>录取方式</span></b></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>2026年</span></span><span><span>7月21日16:00</span></span><span>之前确定营员录取名单，届时将在药学院官网公示入营学生名单，未入选者不另行通知。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>夏令营安排</span></b></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>时间定于2026年7月28-29日。活动安排方案由药学院具体负责实施。</span></p><p><span>1. 各学科、实验室、研究所参观介绍。</span></p><p><span>2. 学术讲座、学术沙龙、硕博导师面对面、学校招生政策解读。</span></p><p><span>3. 参观福建中医药文化博物馆、时珍园（药用植物园科普基地）。</span></p><p><span>4. 参观中药标本馆，了解福建省道地药材。</span></p><p><span>5. 视情况组织参观林则徐纪念馆、三坊七巷等爱国主义教育基地。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>营员待遇</span></b></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>a. 外地正式营员：在营期间</span><strong><span>统一安排住宿</span></strong><span>（免费），凭据报销夏令营来回城际交通费：飞机经济舱/火车硬席（硬座、硬卧）/高铁/动车二等座（因提前到达或延后返回所产生的费用自行解决）。</span></p><p><span>b. 本校与福州本地营员：住宿与交通自理，本校生请提前自行申请暑期留校。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名条件</span></strong></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 申请本次夏令营的同学，请按照上述要求完成全部报名流程。申请者应保证提交的所有报名材料真实、有效、完整。如因提交不实信息或伪造材料造成不良后果，由申请者本人承担。</span></p><p><span>2. 在营期间必须遵守福建中医药大学的相关规定，按照统一的安排进行工作和活动。营员报到后要求全程参加夏令营活动，擅自离营者，将被取消资格，不提供相关资助。</span></p><p><span>3. 营员需准备好身份证、学生证参加夏令营活动，同时应告知所在学校和父母知晓情况。</span></p><p><span>4. 请申请人务必从我院官网获取相关信息，学院不会以单位或个人名义要求申请者提供个人信息或缴纳报名费用。</span></p><p><span>5. 报名营员不足10人不开营。</span></p><p><span>6. 本次夏令营一切事宜解释权福建中医药大学药学院。</span></p></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>联系方式</span></b></p></section><section><section></section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>联系人：蔡老师</span></p><p><span>邮箱：583456388@qq.com</span></p><p><span>夏令营qq群：147087249</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JJvb85tQl1VOYhxRccicA0paZrnoUL0pdVWPLGejH7emoHeuBHibFAEk9ZAmg9lGP9euv8E86XlGteSMCbHGa7S1namet1qru5THELFjfxnW8/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/JJvb85tQl1UrPD1nJZp0hkmmXnkZ1yLWcx4lo5OBkUBzx5zDGgc32hliaHTEoAQ6libsxPpBFHWXdWKbmEP889sEUU4n1H1cyf2CL8zFgMQ1M/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>报名表格↑                    联系QQ群↑</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qpicJQVTfQpRtYRUAj9yR6WrpbdIxVdxia5hAoicSE1D8OO2L2pBBicmJQYpXZXVsIezOVaxfbRpicfyef7LRMZyALz0Zem1GIMtXrolHD5Dsr54/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><strong><span>山海福建</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>活力福州</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>青春正好</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>等你来遇见不一样的中医药世界</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/JJvb85tQl1VniaR77IHreD643j9oj88VlDqEsrbEnNricmxn2wXq8dPdGicSFqDdzoNx1vyRYOlU5hh7nNjmaDaHibDtpcxV0ia3xd2yA6tzNibUI/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>图文来源 | 药学院新媒体部</span></p><p><span>责编 | 刘小芬</span></p><p><span>审核 | 许   文</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"560ca1370bbccd6647a568ff1677ec6b805c7c8dd924bb7dec12a455759fa04d","textLength":2346,"sourceSha256":"5d3e17cf1b977757bd813783288da3a09a8bd39e7fc61bdea5784504119f7773","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1b76de1a0d15ff9a19cd","title":"2026年福建中医药大学药学院2026年暑期优秀大学生/硕士生夏令营招生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:29.178937+00:00"}
